  "title": "AGTTM Part 3 - Static Worksites",
  "abstract": "AGTTM Part 3 - Static Worksites is the most frequently referenced part for Traffic Controllers working on static worksites in Australia. This standard provides comprehensive guidance on the full range of static worksite configurations including single lane closures, multiple lane closures, road closures with detours, shoulder closures, and median works. The document details critical requirements for advance warning systems, transition zones, buffer zones, termination areas, speed zoning requirements, minimum sight distances, taper lengths, and signage spacing.",
